etus [Data: Entities (17129); Relationships (10496)].\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"去甲金霉素 and 地美环素 are confirmed members of the 四环素类抗生素 class\",\n            \"explanation\": \"The drugs 去甲金霉素 (demeclocycline) and 地美环素 (demeclocycline, also referenced as a tetracycline derivative) are formally classified under 四环素类抗生素 based on structured and unstructured pharmacological sources. Their inclusion reinforces the scope of the tetracycline class and implies they share the same interaction profiles and contraindications as the broader class [Data: Entities (4094, 4604); Relationships (56113, 56439)].\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"Iron ions represent a high-risk interaction partner for 四环素类抗生素\",\n            \"explanation\": \"铁离子 (iron ions) are specifically identified as interacting with 四环素类抗生素, contributing to reduced absorption and diminished blood concentration. Clinical reports note that co-administration of doxycycline or methacycline with iron supplements can reduce antibiotic serum levels by 80–90%, underscoring the severity of this interaction. Even staggered dosing may not fully mitigate risk for certain tetracyclines like doxycycline due to enterohepatic recirculation [Data: Entities (12887); Relationships (33796)].\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"rating\": 7.5,\n    \"rating_explanation\": \"The community poses a high clinical impact due to the widespread use of tetracycline antibiotics, their numerous clinically significant interactions with common medications and supplements, and a serious teratogenic risk.\"\n}", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": null, "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null, "provider_specific_fields": {"refusal": null}}, "provider_specific_fields": {}}], "created": 1782121680, "model": "qwen3-max", "object": "chat.completion", "moderation": null, "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": null, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 1337, "prompt_tokens": 6615, "tota